---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Project: 실전 개발 프로젝트 허브"
  description="Study Notes > Labs & Projects > Project — 언리얼 엔진 5.9 곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전 프로젝트 허브 및 개발 아카이브"
>
  <div class="note-header">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="브레드크럼">
      <a href="/learn">Study Notes</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/learn">Labs &amp; Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">Project</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="topic-tag">LABS &amp; PROJECTS // PROJECT HUB</div>
    <h1>Project: 실전 프로젝트 개발 기록 허브</h1>
    <p class="topic-desc">
      이론 스터디에서 검증한 C++ 메모리·수명주기 모델, 게임 엔진 아키텍처, 셰이더 및 VFX 파이프라인을 실제 작동하는 프로토타입과 게임으로 구현하며 남기는 엔지니어링 허브입니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="projects-section">
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <span class="badge">ACTIVE SHOWCASE</span>
      <h2>진행 중인 프로젝트</h2>
      <p>구현 코드와 에셋 구조, 파라미터 설계 근거, PIE/에디터 검증 결과를 마일스톤별로 점진 기록합니다.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="project-showcase">
      <div class="showcase-top">
        <div class="showcase-badges">
          <span class="status-pill active">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            ACTIVE DEV · PHASE 1
          </span>
          <span class="engine-pill">UNREAL ENGINE 5.9 · macOS</span>
          <span class="path-pill">UEStudy / Sandbox / MiniProject</span>
        </div>
        <span class="updated-meta">Updated 2026. 11. 12</span>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-body">
        <div class="showcase-copy">
          <h2>
            <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest">
              곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="project-subtitle">
            무중력 공간에 떠 있는 보송보송한 먼지공·곰팡이 부유체가 물풍선처럼 출렁이며, 조준 방향으로 <strong>긴 촉수(V1)</strong>와 <strong>그물 촉수(V2)</strong>를 뻗어 우주를 탐색·정복해 나가는 UE 5.9 C++ 미니 프로젝트.
          </p>

          <div class="metrics-strip">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">CORE C++</span>
              <span class="metric-value">3 Classes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">CONTENT ASSETS</span>
              <span class="metric-value">16 Assets / 6 Folders</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">TENDRIL STYLES</span>
              <span class="metric-value">V1 Hold · V2 One-Shot</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">TARGET LEVEL</span>
              <span class="metric-value">Lvl_Main (3-Layer Space)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stack-tags">
            <span class="stack-tag">#UE5_9</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#APawnDesign</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#Quaternion6DoF</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#WPO_Elasticity</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#NiagaraRibbon</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#Xcode26_1_1_Isolation</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#M4_16GB_Optimization</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest"
          class="showcase-preview"
          aria-label="곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전 프로젝트 허브 열기"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/projects/fungal-space-conquest/blog-pie-idle.png"
            alt="UE 5.9 Lvl_Main 우주 공간에서 부유 중인 곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전 BP_SpaceDrifterPawn PIE 뷰포트"
            loading="eager"
          />
          <span class="preview-caption">PIE Capture (1920×1378) · Lvl_Main + BP_SpaceDrifterPawn</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="milestone-strip">
        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-01" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 01</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Xcode 26.1.1 격리 &amp; 엔진 분석</h3>
          <p><code>ue-on/off</code> 환경 격리, 공식 MCP 41툴셋, <code>LaunchEngineLoop.cpp</code> &amp; Live Coding 분석</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-02" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 02</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>템플릿 격리 &amp; APawn 직조</h3>
          <p><code>Sandbox/MiniProject</code> 6분류 에셋 분리, <code>ACharacter</code>를 버린 순수 <code>APawn</code> 아키텍처</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-03" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 03</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>우주 환경 시각·인지 설계</h3>
          <p>2D UV 극점 왜곡 → 0-샘플러 <code>M_SpaceSky</code>, <code>AutoExposure</code> 잠금, 폰 부착 3D 먼지</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-04" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 04</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>쿼터니언 6-DoF &amp; 물풍선 탄성</h3>
          <p><code>FRotator</code> 짐벌락 극복 궤도 카메라, 2차 감쇠 스프링, 균일 아이코스피어 WPO</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-05" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 05</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>촉수 V1/V2 &amp; 체감 튜닝기</h3>
          <p>여의봉 방지 조준 래치, 비율·테이퍼 연동 개선, V2 단발형 &amp; UHT 한글 Details 툴팁</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#ch-06" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">MILESTONE 06</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>M4 Air 16GB 메모리 최적화</h3>
          <p>GPU 60% 절감 오판 → 렌더 패스 경량화로 <code>21.4GB → 7.93GB</code> 달성 및 고품질 전량 원복</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-footer">
        <div class="footer-note">
          클라이언트 설계 판단, C++ 소스(<code>SpaceDrifterPawn</code> 등), 엔진/환경 설정(<code>.ini</code>/<code>.zshrc</code>) 및 MCP 실측치를 바탕으로 작성했습니다. 상세 코드와 표는 접기 서랍에 수록되어 있습니다.
        </div>
        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest" class="cta-btn">
          프로젝트 허브 &amp; 개발 기록 읽기 →
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .note-header {
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }
  .topic-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .note-header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 1.5rem + 1.5vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .topic-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .projects-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap p {
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-showcase {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }
  .showcase-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .showcase-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .status-pill,
  .engine-pill,
  .path-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .status-pill.active {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--success);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success);
  }
  .engine-pill {
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-muted);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent);
  }
  .path-pill {
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .updated-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .showcase-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.3rem + 0.8vw, 2rem);
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 a {
    color: var(--text-1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .project-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .project-subtitle strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .metrics-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .metric-item {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .metric-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .metric-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .stack-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .stack-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .showcase-preview {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur), border-color var(--dur), box-shadow var(--dur);
  }
  .showcase-preview:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }
  .showcase-preview img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .preview-caption {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .milestone-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .milestone-card {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .milestone-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .m-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m-arrow {
    color: var(--text-3);
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .milestone-card:hover .m-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .milestone-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .milestone-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .showcase-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .footer-note {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-strong);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .showcase-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .project-showcase {
      padding: 1.3rem;
    }
    .metrics-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
